OL,3,GNEWSAJersey's ultrasound waiting list
OL,4,Aincreases by 23%
OL,5,
OL,6,FA meeting of Jersey's health advisory
OL,7,Fboard has heard how the waiting list
OL,8,Ffor ultrasounds have increased by 23%
OL,9,Fin 2026.
OL,11,FClaire Thompson, the chief operating
OL,12,Fofficer of acute services at Jersey
OL,13,Fhospital, said the rise in demand
OL,14,Freflected patterns in other places.
OL,16,FIn the health board papers the reasons
OL,17,Ffor rising demand included increased
OL,18,Fcancer referrals and pressures caused
OL,19,Fby an ageing population. It found
OL,20,Fdemand had increased by 11%, while
OL,21,Fcapacity to carry our the scans
OL,22,Fincreased by 7%.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
