OL,3,GNEWSAJersey's ultrasound waiting list
OL,4,Aincreases by 23%
OL,5,
OL,6,FThompson said a #400,000 a year
OL,7,Fincrease would help bring down the
OL,8,Fwaiting list but others on the board
OL,9,Fquestioned whether more money was the
OL,10,Fsolution.
